  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to increase public awareness, strengthen collaboration between civil society groups and national authorities in the prevention of human trafficking. The objectives of the grant are to promote public awareness through at least 30 community-based projects and a media campaign, provide training sessions and develop a mapping exercise of vulnerability for legal professionals. Key activities include hosting an international conference, two inter-institutional debate forums, and policy recommendations.</narrative>
  </description>
